  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:069cbff469c91e1fe4ef9b35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，还可以的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0989b2e9eba1d8bdfd3cde2ada6aa04d78a34f5dc417a33b1a496e87c1c86351",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6daa1b298f157ca239ed4f5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还要朝更高的目标迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69373f017d95bbd0848d8a40bc7b5b930b51ffdeab95c43a8fcb80bb4a54f04a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dabea60daac49786ab76863",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会以这次的结果当作训诫的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4af68ea00f2631d8108b2750ffbf4704c0abce6e1bb4b170aedc97c1ff46fea4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e842531ec36e0afc3d9551b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「一骑绝尘无与齐驱」，没错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eb585e9ec2d2065f2fd6077e98c22196caf2ed1fb7c294490cb3b985b9dbcbf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6b0aabeef314540ebfeff34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到了吧──这就是「皇帝」的奔驰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d298c8ac34f4d3594b7fd78179a9faa962000fc5e6dba33654e29ebf86457f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8976585445889d5895687d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样算是击落目标的成果了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4da235bbc296d4c03a5488271448728ff542981ace3ab4e20d0be6ec80d3f7e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad63a3aa67a3fbc40fb16408",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到了吧──这就是「皇帝」的奔驰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d298c8ac34f4d3594b7fd78179a9faa962000fc5e6dba33654e29ebf86457f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8287fe95b3831e5c3349cf7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再次书写历史吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c06535ba8f595015de8cdf51140a79bbfce36da1c7947bb98bf563d4d5b21dae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7a2b8bc921afeb11e389597",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "响彻吧──天下无双的嘶吼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "130c5445f5d662621d7c6798d2d4239a848c89bd81df82d1f45f281131df07ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7691bab7a0d51b670a7a7aa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私も未熟だな。精神統一、書類整理\r\nでもするか。エアグルーヴに連絡を\r\n…いや、彼女には後で報告しよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8bd6ed8ec682e75429b5900ed09b62a9d44f964ea56edf986250963f8bc52a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c63ae0e41a49844bac50b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该做的都已经做了。\r\n之后就只能……拭目以待了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb3ff53474595ad1c8dcaa021e81973a407b3592b462cf22d3cd7d67ff4abfd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c79946b10db36007119d0058",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多到了野兽苏醒的时候了。\r\n……等你很久了喔，白仁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4681a8388717af0f2b8f307502f8f9b920291f11f2ed0df386a031c550b028a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:336549f5fd5ea1d0d7207586",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勤勉精进。我们共同打造出了\r\n出色的祭典呢……那么，接下来\r\n只剩解决那些积着的会长工作了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7847083976602bae12451b5d8674a9578ff3754ec36a4a13f4985cd13d3d33a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e89be766952c4ed3ef855826",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前方若无路可行，那么……就更该勇往直前！\r\n走出自己的路……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78977ea3f27c392e1f0300c5d489bebef74b58e2f06a2bda16fd9f61c7be555b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5da4aea45c805781db98756c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务在这里。\r\n正所谓滴水穿石。哪怕力量\r\n十分渺小，也要努力不懈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a390d2b241a93d46ff168bd91ad63f91f8baaae1a960e50bba688a40e60fd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e88b1ec3a73bbc2b453d857f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有忘了收下报酬吧？正所谓\r\n慎始敬终。自始至终都要谨慎，\r\n在最后划下完美的句号。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd0a30f5553430a67cc5efa91f9679f0e193a71ee47b959f608c06bc63bbe2b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06ffecd53f9da89a5258852a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幼少期、君とのダンスは教える\r\n意味が強かったが…いつか、\r\nライブで競いたいものだな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a8ce9da7a0f81256b910986d692392ca89b49fb8a9d102baca098edecb03f02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e2874b2140642e1e3ef33d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用我的弓箭祛除灾厄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "890c4e858471d9fd3cd71c90698e3bf23bd213abb19edf678975ec7ecbe69494",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ff47a63b3f12d4e734febe1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好瞄准，就能清楚看见目标。\r\n一、二。然后就这样……！\r\n……结束了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd4fb99831d54be410dbd8b8cc1ec7c3f7c9465cc54be22c4ef37cf6b7130cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16c766ca0208a0f5e7fc370b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "势在必行了啊。\r\n那么剩下的就是尽力做好\r\n一本优秀的导览手册了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71af5dac158c10368a539efa6ebb02c4342d817b7fb9ec3ffb3466e8b1514937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "400046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47c9543dc8058d117fa141a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "167c476ae4e50740d222867d26ce1988fafb946c30ad3f608beb919ca0d564f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56f08fb43eb000a616d686a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8eae5c19de1a418e1c2117f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "533af1ec55aaabd2fb64979f1b375b53b2aa3d91c5132bfaaf1eceef39f399ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a25453ef9befd79bab36c16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "533af1ec55aaabd2fb64979f1b375b53b2aa3d91c5132bfaaf1eceef39f399ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:158c680f70e8678ecfc592d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae0d1ca7000d0a1d6996e337c00c38005469ade66f4e595e4b21b05e784807e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b7786711419b8d7b850745b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae0d1ca7000d0a1d6996e337c00c38005469ade66f4e595e4b21b05e784807e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a706fd748c341c60b8bdae6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈……",
      "source_fingerprint": "92fba50df9da167699a94452ce4b050bfc68c8d9ac567abb75917f20925c2c50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d84883c49392b78496c30b50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈……",
      "source_fingerprint": "92fba50df9da167699a94452ce4b050bfc68c8d9ac567abb75917f20925c2c50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "410007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc431407d0bec9d44198df8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈……",
      "source_fingerprint": "92fba50df9da167699a94452ce4b050bfc68c8d9ac567abb75917f20925c2c50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:461c3f0158ba819a7f3afbad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我去向大家展现最棒的Live了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc3e4dc52486f80a67d8aa58298927255540e8629da57ab927d342d1b5958f36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d8cb0f69bb5fac59f02cd51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须响应大家对我的期望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8ed8479b21109e13e8b2b7578b97cece7a72e2fa1cdd390556fe61ef1e120da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfc2e1761922d48f14aaf23c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起朝理想前进吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c612fde6502475c9f7f83d25ad1ac6004c94b1476c87e439e59ea781d4bc83d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82cc2dfa8f7fe320ba285f4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你作好了觉悟，也站在我的立场上，\r\n理解并认同我的理念。这不只让我\r\n感到很开心，也因此很信赖你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3fd9a9994371f90d6d740d77de7bb6543786434fc35d664e968fd92f664d182",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddea80f1b0d91c58f8de9798",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服也是一套决胜服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8245f28d472fce4c960db9e70ef892f9c901f067e8dd7a86e173c59b20a7464c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbe028b02eeeec8d250452f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这样的衣服还真新颖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec2f5f16cd94fce561f57a442625c4fc665b84e05069cd8eeb94675c36e55a18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d6ca8ed3c590db7d49db88a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要和这套决胜服一起朝顶点迈进……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d4d2a8575811b8c062f032856e39ab717a395af50f4d9d08d15a12e350a3ccc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b3600d940bac3e694b6323d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「成为大家的榜样」──\r\n这就是会长该有的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d50581d04f26c57f50bb6e0a73b861bdc5ec3624900eca8639a850f3188a743",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69b577263762416aaaa1bc5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "威风凛凛……我会在演唱会做出所有人都认可的表演。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a3d8a93c151ac526ac63b9f1088f2336c87b59e8caf79db2a658dc7d6fa478a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7555f34911b6b14c65a69c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "站上了「顶点」也不能有一「丁点」\r\n骄傲自满，绝对不能大意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "700037c9a36ff6c79fa901dcc3d850593a964388a420006530e059e6576769e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3256db5d23fcd5428ac220cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，接下来的目标是哪里呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f19b734ea2b2b72321ce4376f40becd409202c09408552fa3b4e79101042a7ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2389485c1212c225b906535a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须拿出配得上配戴菊花的成果才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db9208b2323980859cd2e2e7b5c552b51da01033ce2bd69af74ab8822e6a52b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65452c8b53ca36ad0ea47b4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始展现我的荣光吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aee5cc15c6d74c9d624bbac7644df7e8b779e6c56a27f6df941524d838fc4d1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35df3cb838a8eccd0cdd784e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让大家见识绝对的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f4fde589f2f0ed6ce9c90941527f625b69f49eb1052bf02217ff3e40f31a628",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:043626e8c36186d234c7ac5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然穿便服，\r\n但我仍希望自己能保持警惕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba8f49cebef009a51305a38a3d6dd67cb21d7334d201f77646c2e37f7b8318d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63fa8cb539db466ab186c456",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有留心要穿得朴素又不难看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b44a0bb272698e2ab90de9aa5f3a18a99f0739530028ee26ea0e4ec6e9616a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88f8fdbf71740908ec345c3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服也是一套决胜服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8245f28d472fce4c960db9e70ef892f9c901f067e8dd7a86e173c59b20a7464c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b9ed6fa9829ed5b518dbaf8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这样的衣服还真新颖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec2f5f16cd94fce561f57a442625c4fc665b84e05069cd8eeb94675c36e55a18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ddd863b6a91815720d9d960",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要和这套决胜服一起朝顶点迈进……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d4d2a8575811b8c062f032856e39ab717a395af50f4d9d08d15a12e350a3ccc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f966ac1eea50f0da1954554",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「成为大家的榜样」──\r\n这就是会长该有的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d50581d04f26c57f50bb6e0a73b861bdc5ec3624900eca8639a850f3188a743",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16a910378b31c8ee5cac3c08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "威风凛凛……我会在演唱会做出所有人都认可的表演。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a3d8a93c151ac526ac63b9f1088f2336c87b59e8caf79db2a658dc7d6fa478a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26200e7bb2155dbaaaddf273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "站上了「顶点」也不能有一「丁点」\r\n骄傲自满，绝对不能大意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "700037c9a36ff6c79fa901dcc3d850593a964388a420006530e059e6576769e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19fa1586ce06da2e13440bb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，接下来的目标是哪里呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f19b734ea2b2b72321ce4376f40becd409202c09408552fa3b4e79101042a7ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc122a1fb9f85f9238a70e71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须拿出配得上配戴菊花的成果才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db9208b2323980859cd2e2e7b5c552b51da01033ce2bd69af74ab8822e6a52b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c262e06c2861c32830958c74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始展现我的荣光吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aee5cc15c6d74c9d624bbac7644df7e8b779e6c56a27f6df941524d838fc4d1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e63cd42424c866bafcb419ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让大家见识绝对的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f4fde589f2f0ed6ce9c90941527f625b69f49eb1052bf02217ff3e40f31a628",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d780ae1da5a986b12f70681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c06a2f0c3853f2806a3b65c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "絶対を見せよう",
      "source_fingerprint": "2156f8031eb75e92de31a803a2a2bae6eb2e966c0dc793fcd72443607e33c4d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "800000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:407d6771fe2491ec3cb82c27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "互相切磋吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f0f69dbe025c17c5f0d64c121ea22c588e689c22bd963b921545360003d7cd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:959436d7f9a6f1644098b095",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小试身手就到此为止。\r\n正式开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1664a2ba40233c3f7102f761a9f9fabae32997872ed470e41293fe6e741a98da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fa5df08b572acc4790066ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安，训练员君。\r\n今天也要专心奋斗，\r\n所以我们开始准备训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c9f048b7ad8302aa3816108f1f23e1a38f880ce568c5b41f3145200017420a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24bdf70a19b5aaabb8b5837",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标是登上赛马娘的顶点……\r\n今天也要全力以赴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e61cd91c1402762df18684f7b720d9f150de439522ac4d5b8ec8168525fcd3be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:643520c7ad7a21b60db4f436",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经下午了……时间有限，\r\n迅速果断地展开行动吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92e89fab420ee37ff13c1bd47a2e4ffbb3678dfa9edc5d190eca6ad9b77b664a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e183b60f88d0029fb89b5a51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在上午就把\r\n学生会的工作处理完了。\r\n现在可以专心投入训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "306d0d1ee6804f348134f64f0305de26ca92d17d0cfc936b182f45a6f96b3d95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab00698e044c5df6a7b6f255",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天色已经完全转暗了呢，\r\n但这并不代表今天已经结束。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b459fcf65c96789d805c19576c7892759e45ce85394b8c7093204ed4ab6829dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22953b0f297b21091da485ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上好，训练员君。\r\n到这个时间或许会开始感到疲累，\r\n只要再努力一下就结束了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "085272299f2bda46d4b57b626ab5b837701f741b490be376a2d5805d71b6496d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:310160bbcaead9867cebc726",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经到了后辈们\r\n要开始出道的时期，\r\n我希望她们都能跑出好成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c217b6e6a3e1ee9af897f78d87b40bf90babf19571ddfdfd0a548c6a5b2ab557",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f334595579d744f98a3d1fb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帝王她很亢奋地说\r\n要请我吃冰……\r\n呵呵，得为她空出时间才行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b2e750d889f8b453eb130ac571f1db16ad6416a4688bf0820fd0d0be52ca492",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6196830bc89f9f6560a02b7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天的时候我一定都会赏月，\r\n也许我是憧憬着夜空中的明月\r\n那种闪耀动人的存在吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24f8cbb77e61111f627b8576abc283faf681b41433ebd36e27e58de3f91d931a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:406322b52d88aebc91f44679",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了这个时期赛道上有时会积雪，\r\n所以学生会必须\r\n更加致力于整备工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3271de7516c816f8e98de5ba84fe4b8657b247a9d5c78e4e01e113c42d5ba608",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d84411de9427774af9688476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛也跟武道一样，\r\n要「始于礼，终于礼」吧……所以，\r\n训练员，今天也要请你多多指教了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "114a6fd709d25ae6f29601bc6ea845e794d3f12be95428c789f58dd6a7327d67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6dc49b7d3541233f823d868",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天早上散步时，有个太太\r\n称赞我服装的花纹很漂亮呢。\r\n然后还给了我好吃的糖果喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "231f7c902bb08e4120d7d1eda88898650ec92398d875a0b2ca8d841375ed694b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20cd22c9e84dabb79230bbfc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抱持着正射必中的精神，\r\n真诚地持续创造每一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5c3d3fe9d8e6905f9c546d55f94c1bfa6bf1f3d96a031107930013208e82b4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2793f0aa85f137990b9b250",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一个例行节日是……嗯。\r\n趁天还亮着先联络\r\n负责的人吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "912a8bccdaa013151d3217a51263f13176e71d47496dd7581f9b61930f3cd848",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35f9967bc7de8e368ec4cccf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黑暗会吸引妖魔……\r\n至少得做好准备，\r\n才能在出事时实时应对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e94f3532dedd1ac8118a8f69d8bc489b2b9ef216da087394e9740261da031e94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f67d891a678852cbbfad61ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的个性是越想着该睡了，\r\n就越睡不着的类型。\r\n……祭典前一晚折腾了很久呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4e33242826558553c1f04f3325189a15089d2032554f803259abff3fae126da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c448d61863f71550cdd7be15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呼。这时期的睡魔\r\n是射箭也无法驱走的强敌啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a4fb66ba616a135929817e8060b29516eaffdc55b59488ebaba03212a3d8740",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7237dc71205cfec224383234",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许要在遥远的将来，我才能\r\n打从心底沉静下来……但如果我们\r\n都有时间的话，就一起去祭典吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "538690f4742c07fcd0640fa2a790ff44775a2cc43f0f83c5fd01795ef009ac1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b31c8c294056734365599483",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "菊花和秋之华，还有盾形奖牌……\r\n不，目标是追求更高的王冠啊。\r\n好了，好好享受「祭典」吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5fd57547d6f9af552f2e174c40c213118531fbd48b2a392782734fd40ea4baf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6d2d053fe3948c41d6293a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟外面相比，这里的温度适中。\r\n你最好也暖和一下身体。\r\n……就像我也正在这么做呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82504b67e968f406617950bd1efbb736f1e75dc64fb4d85ced1b359bdbb55616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b460d246ac60d8e64b77636b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1017",
        "90020"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
